      "content": "公開済み3件のcaseに対応する静的比較プロファイルから集計した特徴。件数は観測case数であり、全版共通の断定ではない。\nmodule_stack: protector_wrapper:native pe (1件)、terminal_payload:.net managed pe (1件)\ncapabilities: credential_access:browser (1件)、network:configured_endpoint (1件)、network:connection_retry (1件)、obfuscation:base64 (1件)、packer:themida (1件)、runtime:dotnet (1件)\nfunction_roles: c2_channel_creation (1件)、c2_checkconnect (1件)、credential_blob_decryption_core (1件)、credential_blob_decryption_entry (1件)、entrypoint (1件)、main_orchestrator (1件)、string_decryption (1件)、terminal_configuration (1件)、wcf_binding_configuration (1件)",
